TSP_CSHARP_DOCUMENTATION

This DLL file allows Mechanoid surgeries that allow Mechanoids to perform ANY Work Type, including those that they do not have in the files. Now, your Pikemen can cook!

To employ it, you do this on a Hediff:

<li Class="MechanoidModificationsLWS.HediffCompProperties_SkillModification">
	<workType>Firefighter</workType>
</li>

It's that easy!

